    ('182f18fe-36ea-42c8-9a43-cbbc37d052a6'::uuid, 'geom', 'SRID=4326;POINT(21.2455 43.3411)', '0101000020E6100000DF30DB374833354050EE659EFAA84540', 'fields-wd1-2026-09-26b-s002-rollback:182f18fe-36ea-42c8-9a43-cbbc37d052a6:geom', 'rollback of fields-wd1-2026-09-26b-s002: geom ''0101000020E6100000DF30DB374833354050EE659EFAA84540'' restored on Prebreza', '[{"source": "https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q31184667", "url": "https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q31184667", "quote": "43°20''26.293\"N, 21°14''43.562\"E", "outcome": "found"}, {"source": "https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/11354470029", "url": "https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/11354470029", "quote": "Location: 43.3411826, 21.2454840", "outcome": "found"}, {"source": "WD1 decision (counted, round 0, wd1-r0-b0126)", "decision": "replace", "status": "CONFLICT", "reasoning": "The Prebreza site is the Middle Miocene fossil locality on both banks of the Gluvi Potok stream, protected as the natural monument ''Prebreza'' (WDPA 328830); Wikidata''s item for that monument gives 43.3406, 21.2454 and OpenStreetMap''s outline of the protected area (way 1224208380, of which the cited node is part) lies at 43.3411, 21.2455, which the decree''s boundary grid points confirm. The stored point (43.320, 21.200, a mistyped village coordinate from English Wikipedia) is about 4.3 km away to the south-west.", "value_page": null}]'::jsonb),
